    - **Respiratory failure** (if respiratory muscles are affected)  
    - **Paralysis of the diaphragm** (leading to respiratory failure)  
    - **Autonomic dysfunction** (e.g., bowel/bladder retention, hypertension)  

**2. Post-Polio Syndrome (PPS):**  
