\[
P_{drop} = 1000 \, \text{Pa}
\]

**Step 4: Minimum inlet pressure required to prevent cavitation**
To prevent cavitation, the inlet pressure must be greater than the saturation pressure (vapor pressure) plus the pressure drop.
\[
P_{min} = P_{static} - P_{drop} = 49,050 - 1000 = 48,050 \, \text{Pa}
\]

